    gmeow:bibliographicCitation "ISO/IEC 24707:2018, Information technology — Common Logic (CL): a framework for a family of logic-based languages. Defines the abstract syntax and model-theoretic semantics of Common Logic and its three normative dialects — CLIF (Common Logic Interchange Format), CGIF (Conceptual Graph Interchange Format), and XCL (XML-based notation for Common Logic)." .

